1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,896
Three men vanished from this lighthouse.

2
00:00:02,896 --> 00:00:04,844
Only one coat was left behind.

3
00:00:05,121 --> 00:00:06,959
Scotland, December 1900.

4
00:00:06,959 --> 00:00:10,176
A passing ship sees that the light is out.

5
00:00:10,454 --> 00:00:13,935
When help finally arrives, the station is empty.

6
00:00:13,935 --> 00:00:15,169
No one is inside.

7
00:00:15,445 --> 00:00:19,734
At the west landing, iron railings are bent and a crane is damaged.

8
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:22,287
Two men went down dressed for a storm.

9
00:00:22,287 --> 00:00:24,384
The third ran out without his coat.

10
00:00:24,661 --> 00:00:26,793
One wave may have taken all three.

11
00:00:26,793 --> 00:00:28,800
The full file is on the channel.
